Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.41
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.41: tapping the mini pill opens the full player. Rather than trying to press a button that does not exist, the pill declines the touch so it reaches Music’s own mini player underneath, which opens the player natively with its lyrics screen.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
